---
title: "Components"
eyebrow: "Components"
lead: "Every dsgn component, by group. Each page has live examples, the markup to copy, the attributes and the tokens it uses."
description: "All dsgn.systems components by group: actions, forms, status, content, navigation, overlays and layout."
---
<p>{{ components.list | length }} components. Each is one CSS file you can also load alone; the ones marked <em>needs dsgn.js</em> get keyboard support and behaviour from the optional script.</p>
{%- for g in components.byGroup %}
<h2 id="{{ g.title | lower }}">{{ g.title }}</h2>
<ul class="docs-component-list">
  {%- for c in g.items %}
  <li><a href="{{ c.href }}">{{ c.name }}</a><span>{{ c.lead }}</span></li>
  {%- endfor %}
</ul>
{%- endfor %}
